pcsc-lite
------------------------------------------
The purpose of PCSC Lite is to provide a Windows(R) SCard interface in a very
small form factor for communicating to smart cards and readers. PCSC Lite can
be compiled directly to a desired reader driver or can be used to dynamically
allocate/deallocate reader drivers at runtime (default).

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libpcsclite-devel-2.5.3-1bl1
  libpcsclite1-2.5.3-1bl1
  libpolkit-gobject1_0-127-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1
  python3-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  flex-2.6.4-2
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libpolkit-gobject1-devel-127-1bl2
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  perl-5.44.0-1

Canonical website:
  https://pcsclite.apdu.fr/

Canonical download:
  https://pcsclite.apdu.fr/files/pcsc-lite-2.5.3.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack pcsc-lite-2.5.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./pcsc-lite-2.5.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/pcsc-lite-2.5.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/pcsc-lite-2.5.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libpcsclite1-2.5.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libpcsclite-devel-2.5.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(pcsc-lite)
  /etc/defaults/etc/default/pcscd
  /etc/postinstall/pcsc-lite.sh
  /etc/preremove/pcsc-lite.sh
  /usr/sbin/pcscd.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/pcsc-lite.README
  /usr/share/doc/pcsc-lite/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/pcsc-lite/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/pcsc-lite/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/pcsc-lite/README
  /usr/share/doc/pcsc-lite/setup_spy.sh
  /usr/share/man/man5/reader.conf.5.gz
  /usr/share/man/man8/pcscd.8.gz
  /usr/share/metainfo/fr.apdu.pcsclite.metainfo.xml
  /usr/share/polkit-1/actions/org.debian.pcsc-lite.policy

(libpcsclite1)
  /usr/bin/cygpcsclite-1.dll
  /usr/bin/cygpcsclite_real-1.dll

(libpcsclite-devel)
  /usr/bin/cygpcscspy-0.dll
  /usr/bin/pcsc-spy
  /usr/include/PCSC/debuglog.h
  /usr/include/PCSC/ifdhandler.h
  /usr/include/PCSC/pcsclite.h
  /usr/include/PCSC/reader.h
  /usr/include/PCSC/winscard.h
  /usr/include/PCSC/wintypes.h
  /usr/lib/libpcsclite.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libpcsclite_real.dll.a
  /usr/lib/libpcscspy.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libpcsclite.pc
  /usr/share/man/man1/pcsc-spy.1.gz

